// Windows executable icon. Explorer, the taskbar's pinned entry and the
// Alt-Tab list all read this compiled-in resource rather than anything the
// program does at runtime; SDL_SetWindowIcon in Platform.cpp covers the live
// window, and is the only icon at all on Linux.
//
// 1 is the conventional id: Windows shows the numerically lowest ICON
// resource as the application icon.
1 ICON "../assets/icon.ico"
